    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "New to the market comes this spacious three bedroom residence in the heart of Clondulane village.  This semi-detached property is in good condition throughout and extends to c. 1,146 sq. feet.  It has the benefit of large kitchen/dining area, living room, W.C. and utility room on ground floor level with three bedrooms, bathroom and en-suite on the first floor.  This property is sure to appeal to all sectors of the property market, be it first-time buyers or investors alike.\r\n\r\nViewing comes highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Living Room\t\r\n4.03m x 3.63m\t\r\nCarpet floor, insert gas stove, power point, radiator. \r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining area \t\r\n6.69m x 3.83m\t\r\nTile floor, floor and eye level units, tile splashback, integrated appliances, patio door access to rear, power points, radiator.\r\n\r\nUtility\t\r\n1.90m x 1.73m\t\r\nTile floor, plumbed for washing machine, power points, access to rear.\r\n\r\nW.C.\t\r\n1.97m x 1.30m\t\r\nTile floor, W.H.B., W.C., radiator.\r\n\r\nBedroom\t\r\n3.78m x 3.62m\t\r\nCarpet floor, radiator, power points.\r\n\r\nEn-Suite\t\r\n3.06m x 0.93m\t\r\nTile floor, W.H.B., W.C., shower unit with electric shower, radiator.\r\n\r\nBedroom\r\n3.71m x 3.01m\t\r\nCarpet floor, power points, radiator, T.V. point.\r\n\r\nBedroom\t\r\n3.08m x 2.72m\t\r\nCarpet floor, power points, radiator, T.V. point.\r\n\r\nBathroom\t\r\n2.62m x 2.62m\t\r\nTile floor, W.H.B., W.C., radiator, bath unit.\r\n\r\nServices:\t\r\n-Mains Water\r\n-Mains Sewerage\r\n-Gas Fired Central Heating\t\r\n\r\nEircode:\tP61 NY52"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "- Excellent location within Clondulane village and only five minutes drive to Fermoy town centre. \r\n- Gas fired central heating.\r\n- All contents included in sale. \r\n- Ready for immediate occupation.\r\n- Well laid-out rear garden with patio area."
      },
